===Verb===
{{en-verb|ghostwrites|ghostwriting|ghostwrote|ghostwritten}}

# {{lb|en|authorship|intransitive}} To write under the name of another (especially [[literary]] works).
#: ''Mariana would rather not '''ghostwrite''' for a living because she finds it a thankless task.''
# {{lb|en|authorship|transitive}} To [[author]] a literary work or [[speech]] in the place of another.
#: ''The president has someone to '''ghostwrite''' his addresses.''

